    "body": "Stopped before claiming #1863 because its required dependency #1862 is unavailable.\nUpstream main 17a8c6e7608bb7078f75ec335361839712e51425 has the DXF reader, but no ImportDxf command or Sketch component. A git grep for ImportDxf, struct Sketch, and Add DXF profile under crates returned no matches.\n#1862 remains open. The open PR searches for 1862 and DXF returned no results, so there is no prerequisite PR to stack on.\nThe Stock page import, missing-units prompt, placement controls, and virtual model workflow need that command layer. Implementing it here would exceed the instruction to work only #1863.\nNo claim, worktree, code change, pinning test, or gate run was made. The per-file overlap check was not started. Resume when #1862 is available on an allowed base.\n",
